Z||000002||william_thorniii||12-22-2000||08:37 AM||||I have placed an order for a HOT COAT deluxe kit $200.  Boilermaker and I are going to share it.  It should arrive just after the new year.  <P>In the past, I was a detailer.  I used lots of Eastwood products.  Each and every one is/was top notch.  <P><BR>hey Dad,<P>Where and what did you find for $500?  does that include a baking system?  The only thing that is holding me back right now is that I don't have a good source of 220 in the garage.  The funny thing is that there is a 220 plug in the living room of the apt!  No it is not for the dryer... that is in the basement.  Strange huh?<P>William T. Thorn, III<BR>||||reg||14
